&lt;h3&gt;Settings&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep shortcut descriptions readable beside their keycaps instead of wrapping one character per line. Refresh section transitions on every animation frame and use a brief fade with gentle settling.&lt;span class="credit"&gt;PR &lt;a href="https://github.com/nowledge-co/con-terminal/pull/563"&gt;#563&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://github.com/wey-gu"&gt;@wey-gu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
