&lt;h3&gt;Settings and dialogs&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soften settings section changes with brief content and selection transitions, keep the floating settings frame steady, and make navigation keyboard accessible. Respect Reduce Motion and preserve unsaved edits across sections.&lt;span class="credit"&gt;PR &lt;a href="https://github.com/nowledge-co/con-terminal/pull/562"&gt;#562&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://github.com/wey-gu"&gt;@wey-gu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give common con-authored dialogs consistent button spacing, rounding and action hierarchy, including setup, configuration recovery/import, handoff, agent-close confirmations and the unsaved-settings prompt.&lt;span class="credit"&gt;PR &lt;a href="https://github.com/nowledge-co/con-terminal/pull/562"&gt;#562&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://github.com/wey-gu"&gt;@wey-gu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;footer&gt;&lt;a href="https://con.nowledge.co/changelog/"&gt;Read the full changelog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;
&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;
